# Committed on purpose.
#
# This is the *public* Spotify client id. Authorization Code with PKCE exists
# precisely so a browser app needs no client secret, and there is none here or
# anywhere else in this repository — the id alone grants nothing.
#
# It has to be committed because `.env.local` is git-ignored: without this file
# the GitHub Pages build compiles an empty client id, `isConfigured()` returns
# false, and Signal silently drops to System Audio on the deployed site while
# working perfectly on localhost. The deploy workflow can still override it with
# a VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID repository secret.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=3374b075167d4a2f901e80763d196e53
